# ============================================================================
# smith-docker-sandbox
#
# Ordered by how much damage committing the thing would do, worst first.
# ============================================================================

# ── Engagement output — the real leak risk in a pentest repo ────────────────
# If anyone ever runs a scan with this repo as the working directory, or copies
# results here, these files carry live findings: discovered credentials, session
# tokens, internal hostnames, request/response bodies and client-identifying
# data. Mirrors agent-smith's own .gitignore so the two can't disagree.
findings.json
coverage_matrix.json
session.json
session_cost.json
quick_log.json
qa_state.json
steering_queue.json
wishlist_queue.json
recovery_latest.json
adjudication_log.jsonl
pentest_metrics.jsonl
gh-issues.md
artifacts/
pocs/
threat-model/
logs/
smith-output/
*.sig

# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env matters twice over here: agent-smith reads it from its repo root AND
# .env values OVERRIDE the inherited environment, so a stray one both leaks and
# silently clobbers keys passed via `sbx run -e`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.kdbx
credentials
credentials.json
secrets.yml
secrets.yaml
.netrc
.npmrc
.dockerconfigjson
# agent-smith's per-run shared secrets, in case a logs/ tree is ever copied in
.kali_api_token
.msf_api_secret
.integrity_key
dashboard.token
mobsf.key

# ── Build output — multi-GB and architecture-specific: rebuild, don't share ──
# The saved tool-image tarballs (Kali alone is ~4 GB compressed) and the
# distributable template tar. build.sh regenerates all of it.
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
claude-example/images/*
!claude-example/images/.gitkeep
# The pinned agent-smith clone build.sh caches for the Kali build context.
.build-cache/

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# ── Node ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Logs and temp ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.pid
tmp/
.tmp/

# ── OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.nfs*

# ── Editors ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project
